1..7
ok 1 - BEGIN {} runs only once
ok 2 - BEGIN {...} ran at compile time
ok 3 - CHECK {...} ran at compile time
ok 4 - INIT {...} ran at runtime, but ASAP
ok 5 - ENTER {...} at runtime, but before the mainline body
ok 6 - $var gets initialized at END time
ok 7 - $eof_var gets assigned at END time
